OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA blustery day with showers and
OL,6,Fstrong, gusty winds, perhaps some
OL,7,Fshelter for Ayrshire with less showers
OL,8,Fhere. Quite cloudy but a few brighter
OL,9,Fspells in between showers.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining windy and some
OL,12,Fshowers continuing to push in from the
OL,13,Fwest, more in the way of clear spells
OL,14,Ffor Ayrshire, feeling quite chilly.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FWinds gradually easing during
OL,17,Fthe day and some Autumn sunshine for
OL,18,Fmost areas, any showers in the west
OL,19,Fbecoming isolated, quite a pleasant
OL,20,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
