OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fto start the day on Monday but this
OL,7,Fwill become patchy and feeling a lot
OL,8,Fwarmer, perhaps more settled towards
OL,9,Fthe middle of the week, few showers at
OL,10,Ftimes.
